1
00:00:00,550 --> 00:00:02,720
(Bernadette:)me and Howard to have dinner
with her and Leonard?

2
00:00:02,720 --> 00:00:04,320
(Penny:)Oh, that's nice.

3
00:00:04,320 --> 00:00:06,190
(Amy:)No, it's not.

4
00:00:06,190 --> 00:00:07,690
It's a strategic maneuver.

5
00:00:07,690 --> 00:00:10,320
(Amy:)Leonard's new girlfriend is
testing Bernadette's loyalty

6
00:00:10,320 --> 00:00:11,520
(Amy:)to you and the group.

7
00:00:11,530 --> 00:00:13,490
(Amy:)That bitch is crafty.

8
00:00:15,930 --> 00:00:18,160
- You think?
- Of course.

9
00:00:18,160 --> 00:00:20,470
(Amy:)How does the cheetah attack
a herd of wildebeests?

10
00:00:20,470 --> 00:00:22,640
(Amy:)By going after
its weakest member.

11
00:00:23,640 --> 00:00:26,910
(Bernadette:)Well, what makes me
the weakest member?

12
00:00:26,910 --> 00:00:31,110
(Amy:)Your trusting nature coupled
with your teeny-tiny body.

13
00:00:31,110 --> 00:00:33,710
(Amy:)You wouldn't last a minute
on the Serengeti.

14
00:00:33,710 --> 00:00:36,200
(Penny:)Okay, Amy,
you're being silly.

15
00:00:36,200 --> 00:00:38,320
I'm not concerned about
who hangs out with who.

16
00:00:38,320 --> 00:00:39,820
(Penny:)And I certainly
don't have a problem

17
00:00:39,820 --> 00:00:42,320
(Penny:)with Leonard's new girlfriend
who wears way too much makeup.

18
00:00:43,460 --> 00:00:46,160
(Penny:)Ooh, these are cute.

19
00:00:46,160 --> 00:00:47,390
(Penny:)Of course if I buy them,

20
00:00:47,390 --> 00:00:50,500
(Penny:)I'll have to rent
my womb out to a gay couple.

21
00:00:52,730 --> 00:00:54,880
(Bernadette:)It doesn't matter. I'm going to
tell her we can't make it.

22
00:00:54,890 --> 00:00:56,700
Oh, no. You have to go.

23
00:00:56,700 --> 00:00:57,890
(Bernadette:)I don't understand.

24
00:00:57,890 --> 00:01:00,810
(Bernadette:)I thought I was
a teeny-tiny wildebeest.

